cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: "Choosing how to publish a research dataset: evidence from PPDS"
abstract: "A guide, toolkit decision standard and worksheet for choosing file formats, readers and access software when publishing a research dataset that must work from a public repository and from a local download. The plantar pressure dataset (PPDS) serves as a worked case, with its benchmark evidence archived."
authors:
  - name: BMClab
